    "title": "Airport Simulator: Tycoon City",
    "description": "Welcome boss ! As an airport tycoon, your mission is to build and customize your city\u2019s airport. Every decision is yours as your airport gets larger and more successful. Make smart choices to keep your passengers happy and your airlines partnerships growing. Think, plan, decide and join a community of over 7 million tycoons!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfd7 Shape your dream airport: the airport is a city itself: as an airport tycoon, you will need to build it from scratch, grow it, and ensure your airport\u2019s infrastructure is ready to receive your planes.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd1d Think strategically: negotiate like a true airport tycoon and unlock new partnerships with airline companies, manage contracts and build your relationships.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb5 Welcome city arrivals: manage passenger flows from their arrival from the city, provide comfort, and create shopping options. Boost spending, profits, and ensure passenger satisfaction.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca Manage it all: from passenger inflows to air traffic, check-in, security, gates, planes, and flight scheduling. Can you be the ultimate airport tycoon?\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 BRING YOUR AIRPORT TO LIFE \ud83c\udf10\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f Build and customize your airport's infrastructure in 3D, from terminals and runways to coffee shops and stores. You can also choose from a wide range of virtual items to decorate your dream airport.\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f Organize your airport to meet your passengers\u2019 needs: improve processes, profitability and provide a greater level of comfort, which will have a knock-on effect on your relationships with partner airlines. The airport is like a city that needs to be managed by its tycoon!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 PICK A STRATEGY AND MANAGE PARTNERSHIPS \ud83c\udf10\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f Decide on your airport strategy, explore until finding the perfect balance between low-cost and premium flights. Decide on flight types: regular and charter flights, short and medium-haul planes, and the possibility of opening general airlines routes.\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f As an airport tycoon, you will need to sign partnerships to define the number of flights in your airport. Each time you sign for extra flights in addition to an existing contract, you strengthen your relationship with the partner airline.\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f Build relationships: to build your dream airport, you will need to manage relationships with global airlines. Each flight brings bonuses, but beware of overcommitting \u2013 you might risk damaging partnerships and losing contracts!\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f Choose from among our 3D plane models to fulfill your contractual obligations.\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f Define your schedule on a 24-hour basis, planning air traffic up to 2 weeks in advance.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 FLEET AND PASSENGER MANAGEMENT \ud83c\udf10\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f Your airport\u2019s success depends on passenger satisfaction, optimal services, and plane fleet management. Consider factors like check-ins, on-time performance, and boarding efficiency to impress global airlines.\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f As a tycoon, ensure your airport\u2019s schedule for take-offs and landings is on point. Check runway conditions, timely passenger boarding, and efficient airport services including refuelling and catering. Partner airline satisfaction depends on your punctuality and service quality.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 WHAT IS A TYCOON GAME? \ud83c\udf10\r\n\r\nBusiness simulation games are called \"Tycoon\" games. In those games, players attempt to manage the activities of a city or company. In this case, the aim is to manage a virtual airport and its planes as its CEO.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 ABOUT US \ud83c\udf10\r\n\r\nWe are Playrion, a French video game development studio based in Paris. We are driven by the desire to design free to play mobile games linked to the world of aviation and offering a top notch user experience. We love planes, and anything that\u2019s related to them. Our entire office has been decorated with airport iconography and plane models, including the recent addition of the Concorde from Lego. If you share our passion for the world of aviation, or simply love management games, our games are for you!",
